  "description": "Automatic HTTP traffic collection middleware for Azure App Services. Zero code changes required. Uses ASP.NET Core IHostingStartup to inject middleware for comprehensive API security monitoring. Supports .NET 6.0, 7.0, 8.0, 9.0, and 10.0. Intelligently captures HTTP request/response data including headers, bodies, and timing information with smart handling for streaming/SSE (headers only) and WebSocket connections (excluded). Sends data in real-time to Salt Security API for advanced threat detection and security analysis.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
